{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261102/photo/bkn-20261102085752480-1102_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261102090540\"/><p>女子被送往將軍澳醫院救治。</p><p>清水灣泳灘有人遇溺。今日(2日)早上7時18分，一名女子在清水灣泳灘游泳期間懷疑遇溺，在場人事發現合力將事主救回岸上並進行急救。救護車接報到場將昏迷女子送往將軍澳醫院救治，其身份及遇溺原因有待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:26:09.113925+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T00:57:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T01:38:25.395337+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T01:20:54.081797+00:00","content_hash":"2c25969a9acfc478d9e485dc5ea0f5a9720f77c97ddd4e49ca062ece278976a7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}